                                It instantly autofills addresses for 8 in 10 shoppers, corrects invalid details, validates PIN codes, and promotes prepaid payments—reducing address errors, low-intent COD orders, and payment failures that can become NDRs or RTOs. Pragma also reports 15%+ more conversions and <strong>30% fewer checkout abandonments</strong>.
